#~ "hit rate) {cite}`langchain2026tbench`; (c) spec-observance signals (broken-"
#~ "link count on the docs site, stale `verified:` dates on hands-on artefacts, "
#~ "schema drift between `AGENTS.md` and the MCP manifest) "
#~ "{cite}`martraire2019living`."
